VALUES ('4adc514c-4623-42de-ad3b-47112e78f69d', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 46, 'Which of the following best describes a reasonable general principle for approaching an unfamiliar Surgery-section code-selection question specifically involving neurosurgical or hernia repair procedures, synthesizing this paper with Papers 1-3?');
VALUES ('4adc514c-4623-42de-ad3b-47112e78f69d', '61704cd6-7ec9-4ad2-a39e-76274596499b', 'This is a further capstone synthesis reinforcing the same core Surgery-section analytical discipline (indication, approach, device/material, complexity/history) already established throughout this content, now applied concretely to neurosurgery and hernia repair — the consistent through-line across all four papers'' Surgery-section content.', 'Surgery — authored from standard CPT Surgery section conventions covering neurosurgery/spine and hernia repair; not copied from the copyrighted CPT codebook or an official exam bank.');

VALUES ('30d314fa-6a5f-4fd0-b611-ee118a7ebd94', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 47, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for a spinal cord stimulator trial (temporary lead placement to assess treatment response) versus permanent spinal cord stimulator implantation?');
