VALUES ('ec0d4fee-9843-4197-b870-c8b42757e4cf', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 48, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for percutaneous versus surgical (paddle) lead placement for a spinal cord stimulator?');
VALUES ('ec0d4fee-9843-4197-b870-c8b42757e4cf', 'b2b2605e-d911-4db5-9cc2-77dee59a4272', 'This reinforces the approach-specificity theme applied to spinal cord stimulator lead placement — percutaneous and open/surgical paddle-lead techniques are genuinely different approaches with distinct codes.', 'Surgery — authored from standard CPT Surgery section conventions covering neurosurgery/spine and hernia repair; not copied from the copyrighted CPT codebook or an official exam bank.');

VALUES ('32eaab10-6df8-46df-be52-81020034850f', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 49, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for intrathecal (spinal) pain pump implantation for chronic pain management?');
