VALUES ('27b113c7-0fa5-4ec2-aa77-c53c011e9093', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 50, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for refilling/reprogramming an implanted intrathecal pain pump at a follow-up visit, as distinguished from the initial implantation procedure?');
VALUES ('27b113c7-0fa5-4ec2-aa77-c53c011e9093', '144f2c0d-7e20-4bdb-acfc-c352cb667dcf', 'This reinforces the initial-placement-versus-ongoing-management coding distinction (already established for pacemakers, VP shunts, and other implanted devices) applied to intrathecal pain pumps — refill/reprogramming is distinct, ongoing device management, not part of an indefinitely-bundled original implantation global period.', 'Surgery — authored from standard CPT Surgery section conventions covering neurosurgery/spine and hernia repair; not copied from the copyrighted CPT codebook or an official exam bank.');

VALUES ('61c89ff7-e09c-4fee-902a-7ff6c250cccf', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 51, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for a discectomy (removal of a herniated disc) performed via a minimally invasive/microdiscectomy technique versus an open discectomy?');
