VALUES ('4a7dc506-4169-45aa-846d-e79bf445624e', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 53, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for a laparoscopic ventral/incisional hernia repair, as distinguished from a laparoscopic inguinal hernia repair already discussed?');
VALUES ('4a7dc506-4169-45aa-846d-e79bf445624e', '7cf5d217-b4e0-4a45-a055-ea50af05d3d3', 'This reinforces that CPT hernia repair coding is structured by specific hernia TYPE/anatomic location (inguinal, umbilical, ventral/incisional, etc.), each with its own code family — not a single generic hernia code regardless of location, with mesh use as an ADDITIONAL (not sole) code-selection factor within each location-specific family.', 'Surgery — authored from standard CPT Surgery section conventions covering neurosurgery/spine and hernia repair; not copied from the copyrighted CPT codebook or an official exam bank.');

VALUES ('4c3b40fb-63cd-4c58-aadc-4ecf4b6603ea', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 54, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for a hiatal hernia repair performed as part of an anti-reflux (fundoplication) procedure, as distinguished from an abdominal wall hernia repair (inguinal, umbilical, ventral)?');
