VALUES ('9204a2b0-29e2-413c-ad38-bab0a688c5ce', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 55, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding when a fundoplication (anti-reflux procedure) is performed together with hiatal hernia repair during the same operative session?');
