VALUES ('88aa7cf2-9bbe-4373-be73-6891c6336996', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 56, 'Which of the following best describes correct coding for repair of a parastomal hernia (a hernia occurring adjacent to a surgical stoma)?');
