VALUES ('89af11c3-c49d-4541-9c65-7744162d7fd7', '161a5441-b93a-4090-955b-3ea097d0b2fe', 60, 'Which of the following best describes the single most important overarching lesson for approaching CPT Surgery-section coding, synthesizing the entirety of this four-paper series'' Surgery-section content (integumentary, cardiovascular, orthopedic, urologic, ENT, neurosurgical, hernia, and vascular access procedures)?');
